{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">RTS, but the recruited soldiers will act automatically:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each soldier has different characteristics/attribute values/action methods. As the lord of the castle, the player chooses the appropriate soldiers and buildings, manages the economy/defense/attack, and destroys the opponent's castle only through your strategy rather than operation!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose the map you want to play: different terrain, map size, resource richness, distance between camps, etc. will bring different gaming experiences.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can freely adjust the difficulty: simply suppress the enemy, fight evenly, or take on the most difficult challenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play the campaign alone/two-player on-screen battle/LAN online battle, try to destroy castles everywhere in different modes, and win the castle war!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3525580?t=1744040129","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3525580?t=1744040129","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3525580/2cac30d230becb60d4fb0e4462080d08abf76cd6/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744040129","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3525580/2cac30d230becb60d4fb0e4462080d08abf76cd6/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744040129","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"LAN PvP","id":47},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen PvP","id":37},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3582720,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">RTS, but the recruited soldiers will act automatically:</p><p cla